{"title":"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(answer_choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (answer choices)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/e/77ecca71bc409fdb651554b2265f798782a78dcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1 + 2)^2 - (1^2 + 2^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"155\" height=\"21\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/3/e93a86e0d56f4195b35cc90cf8a7af903037e2aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 14 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 12 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"406\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using order of operations, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/82092eb6c445de44dd5666d5d414e69393654d45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1 + 2)^2 - (1^2 + 2^2) = (3)^2 - (1 + 4) = 9 - 5 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"431\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/8/128da4bb96993d01224f5b733fd0a14c06c975b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + y)^2 - (x^2 + y^2) = x^2 + 2xy + y^2 - x^2 - y^2 = 2xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>We can now plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> to get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/2/f020af58fef52d05ab9a9f01b26fdbbd2277e629.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2xy = 2 \\times 1 \\times 2 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"206\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28answer_choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(answer_choices)\">Solution 3 (answer choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (answer choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/a/a4a0033dd85c236e18e80b7e12612c7ba6649bfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^2 + 2^2 = 1 + 4 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"155\" height=\"18\" /> and all of the numbers involved in the equation are integers, we can notice that the number must be a perfect square after adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7af96f871b268e88293326a2e3e47dd3c56c049b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14 + 5 = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/1/8c1cdc7648aefb5037c673b5c3684754ecc478ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 + 5 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cda1a27fa2e448ac727bb0425727c1e5b22bb6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 5 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/e/c3e198fea58a0fedb561dcd31aa07dab7c0ad349.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 + 5 = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/a/eaa37f6d11d98366a5acf61364c2ce485c52b7de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 5 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Of these numbers, the only number that was a perfect square after adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/4/78431c70c8a0e96ab8ac939de6625d8244d02c9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Pr